	(descr "Voltage-divider diagram for Margay's analog reference, drawn by Andy Wickert (2021, Eagle VDIV_MARGAY_2021) and redrawn in KiCad lines and text on the bottom silkscreen (2026-11-12, Project-Margay#80): REF to 1V8; Ax through the on-board resistor and the front jumper (JP) to ground. Same geometry as the Eagle drawing; 0.127 mm strokes, 0.8 mm text. Artwork: no pads, excluded from position files (the BoM lists it as DNP, as the symbol says).")
